  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Systems 2030 MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to contribute to the creation of foundations for sustainable food systems that deliver improved livelihoods and safe, affordable and nutritious diets for all. 
 The Trust Fund will promote new ways of doing business in creating sustainable food systems that integrate simultaneous pursuit of health for people, the planet, and the economy, including a one health approach that explicitly recognizes the interlinkage of human health, animal health, and the health of ecosystems (&#x201C;One Health&#x201D;).&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
